{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41852","headline":"云 · 李中","name":"云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠悠离洞壑，冉冉上天津。\n捧日终爲异，从龙自有因。\n高行四海雨，暖拂万山春。\n静与霞相近，闲将鹤最亲。\n帝乡归莫问，楚殿梦曾频。\n白向封中起，碧从诗里新。\n冷容横钓浦，轻缕绊蟾轮。\n不滞浓还淡，无心卷复伸。\n非烟聊拟议，干吕在逡巡。\n会作五般色，爲祥覆紫宸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}